From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:58:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 217/342] NeoCam, CodyCam: clips in H.264 from the hardware
 encoder

The recorder takes the first codec that sets up: the S905's H.264
encoder, else MPEG-4. With the hardware encoder, NeoCam's Auto frame
rate is the camera's at every size (1080p at 30); its Capture tab says
which encoder its clips get.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/apps/codycam/VideoRecorder.cpp | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 src/apps/codycam/VideoRecorder.h   | 15 +++--
 src/apps/neocam/MainWindow.cpp     | 15 ++++-
 src/apps/neocam/MainWindow.h       |  2 +
 4 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/apps/codycam/VideoRecorder.cpp b/src/apps/codycam/VideoRecorder.cpp
